@startuml watchlist-command-flow
!include ../../sellStocks/diagrams/sell-style.puml
title Proposed watchlist extension · edit one aggregate
actor Client
participant "REST adapter" as REST
participant "Command service\nvia inbound port" as Service
participant "Repository adapter\nvia outbound port" as Repo
participant "Watchlist" as W
Client -> REST : add alert: AAPL, 150
REST -> Service : validated command
Service -> Repo : load watchlist
Repo --> Service : aggregate
Service -> W : addAlert(AAPL, 150)
note right of W
  Positive threshold
  No duplicate ticker + threshold
  Several thresholds per ticker allowed
end note
Service -> Repo : save with conflict protection
Repo --> Service : success
Service --> REST : updated watchlist
REST --> Client : mapped response
note over Service, Repo
  Proposed transactional command boundary
  Commit must succeed before reporting success
end note
@enduml
